    "title": "3 people shot, 1 in custody after shooting in Rensselaer County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "New York State Police are investigating a shooting in Grafton. Police said the shooting happened at around 6:40 p.m. Wednesday at a home on South Road (County Route 85) in Grafton. Investigators said when police arrived, a person walked out of the home with a firearm. Following a short standoff, the person was taken into custody. A search of the residence lead to the discovery of multiple people with gunshot wounds. Police have not yet announced how many people were shot, and their condition is unknown at this time. Police said there’s no threat to the public. A press conference about the shooting is set to be held on Thursday morning where police are expected to release more information.",
